        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Drop Duplicates\n\nPasses each distinct value through once and drops repeats. It runs in-process with no model, no key and no cost.\n\n**How it works:** \"Source list\" holds six colour names with two repeats. \"Fan out\" emits them one at a time into \"Drop\", which forwards a value only the first time it appears. \"Result\" collects the four unique colours.\n\n**Try this:** Replace the strings in \"Source list\" with objects such as {\"sku\": \"A1\", \"size\": \"M\"} and set the key on \"Drop\" to sku, so items are compared on that one field."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
